## 3. PROPOSED TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE
* **Mobile Applications:** **React Native (Expo)** compiled for both **Android** (`.apk`/`.aab`) and **iOS** (`.ipa`) using a unified role-based codebase (Patient Mode & Practitioner Mode).
* **Admin Operations Dashboard:** **Next.js (React)** with Tailwind CSS for fast desktop and tablet oversight.
* **Backend API & Live Tracking Engine:** **Node.js (NestJS)** hosted on **Railway** with WebSockets for real-time practitioner GPS streaming and instant dispatch notifications.
* **Database & Secure Document Storage:** **PostgreSQL** on Railway for encrypted user/visit records, paired with **Cloudflare R2** for practitioner license storage.
* **Cost-Controlled Mapping:** OpenStreetMap / Leaflet integration for map rendering with external Google Maps navigation handoff to eliminate high recurring map API bills.

